      "writtenOn": "2024-04-08T18:31:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Sergiu,\n\nwe record and playback a small subset of Vulkan commands to call the vkCreate* for all Vulkan objects on snapshot load, \"Playback\" is referring to the vulkan command playback on snapshot load.\n\nPlayback was triggered in line 514: `snapshot()-\u003eload(stream, gfxLogger, healthMonitor);`. VkDecoderSnapshot::load only re-creates the vulkan objects but does not load any image / buffer contents. Actual image content is loaded in line 587: `loadImageContent`.\n\nCurrently the layout transform is done in line 587: `loadImageContent` (after loading image content, the last command will transform it from transfer_dst to imageInfo.layout). We still have missing corner cases at the moment. (Actually missing important scenarios... they are not really corner cases.)\n\nI will add it in the comments.",
